<title>UK: NAB sets A$100 million seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>NAB sets A$100 million seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL AUSTRALIA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    23.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.01    PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
